serID":"UR_6KACh5YeBYAQwaq","Timestamp":1784516192,"Removed":true},{"Message":"In this example, you should focus only on whether the final word library is a natural interpretation of the picture.\n\nYou should not judge whether the picture proves that the person is a woman or whether she \"needed\" to do something. Instead, treat the rest of the sentence as given and judge only whether the sentence ending fits the situation shown.","ID":"NO_d6EyhGRjeGBVsNg","UserID":"UR_6KACh5YeBYAQwaq","Timestamp":1784516285,"Removed":true}],"UserStatuses":{"UR_6KACh5YeBYAQwaq":"Expanded"},"ParentID":"QID8","ID":"NT_bDRwytlecLA6LIi"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_d7qMiMtKwcN5RL8","Element":"PL","PrimaryAttribute":"Preview Link","SecondaryAttribute":null,"TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"PreviewType":"Brand","PreviewID":"7dcf04d1-ccdd-4398-a1d4-488b289c5f08"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_d7qMiMtKwcN5RL8","Element":"PROJ","PrimaryAttribute":"CORE","SecondaryAttribute":null,"TertiaryAttribute":"1.1.0","Payload":{"ProjectCategory":"CORE","SchemaVersion":"1.1.0"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_d7qMiMtKwcN5RL8","Element":"QC","PrimaryAttribute":"Survey Question Count","SecondaryAttribute":"10","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":null},{"SurveyID":"SV_d7qMiMtKwcN5RL8","Element":"QG","PrimaryAttribute":"QG_VUgsVtWWiJVh8eP","SecondaryAttribute":"Default Quota Group","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"ID":"QG_VUgsVtWWiJVh8eP","Name":"Default Quota Group","Selected":true,"MultipleMatch":"PlaceInAll","Public":false,"Quotas":[]}},{"SurveyID":"SV_d7qMiMtKwcN5RL8","Element":"QGO","PrimaryAttribute":"QGO_QuotaGroupOrder","SecondaryAttribute":null,"TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":["QG_VUgsVtWWiJVh8eP"]},{"SurveyID":"SV_d7qMiMtKwcN5RL8","Element":"RS","PrimaryAttribute":"RS_81YOC9r212FMlCe","SecondaryAttribute":"Default Response Set","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":null},{"SurveyID":"SV_d7qMiMtKwcN5RL8","Element":"SCO","PrimaryAttribute":"Scoring","SecondaryAttribute":null,"TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"ScoringCategories":[],"ScoringCategoryGroups":[],"ScoringSummaryCategory":null,"ScoringSummaryAfterQuestions":0,"ScoringSummaryAfterSurvey":0,"DefaultScoringCategory":null,"AutoScoringCategory":null}},{"SurveyID":"SV_d7qMiMtKwcN5RL8","Element":"SO","PrimaryAttribute":"Survey Options","SecondaryAttribute":null,"TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"BackButton":"false","SaveAndContinue":"true","SurveyProtection":"PublicSurvey","BallotBoxStuffingPrevention":"false","NoIndex":"Yes","SecureResponseFiles":"true","SurveyExpiration":"None","SurveyTermination":"DefaultMessage","Header":"","Footer":"","ProgressBarDisplay":"None","PartialData":"+1 week","ValidationMessage":"","PreviousButton":"","NextButton":"","SurveyTitle":"Qualtrics Survey | Qualtrics Experience Management","SkinLibrary":"mit","SkinType":"component","Skin":{"brandingId":null,"templateId":"*simple","overrides":null},"NewScoring":1,"SurveyMetaDescription":"The most powerful, simple and trusted way to gather experience data. Start your journey to experience management and try a free account today.","SurveyName":"Picture-Sentence Compatibility Ratings (template)"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_d7qMiMtKwcN5RL8","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1","SecondaryAttribute":"In this study, you will see a series of pictures paired with sentences. Your task is to judge how...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"In this study, you will see a series of pictures paired with sentences. Your task is to judge how compatible the final word of the sentence is with the situation shown in the picture. When making your judgment: Focus on the final word of the sentence. Treat the rest of the sentence as given. Base your judgment on what is shown in the picture and what would naturally make sense in that situation. You may consider the people, objects, actions, setting, facial expressions, and body language shown in the picture, as long as your judgment is based on what is visibly present. The picture does not need to prove that the sentence ending is the only possible interpretation. Instead, decide whether the final word is a natural and reasonable way to complete the sentence given the picture. Please rely on your immediate, common-sense impression rather than overanalyzing each item. Use the following scale: 1 &ndash; Not compatible at all The final word is clearly inconsistent with or unrelated to the picture. 2 &ndash; Slightly compatible The final word is possible, but it would be an unusual interpretation of the picture. 3 &ndash; Moderately compatible The picture provides mixed or ambiguous support for the final word. 4 &ndash; Compatible The final word is a reasonable interpretation of the picture. 5 &ndash; Very compatible The final word is a natural and highly compatible interpretation of the picture. There are no right or wrong answers. We are interested in your own judgment.","DataExportTag":"Q1","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"In this study, you will see a series of pictures paired with sentences. Your task is to judge how...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Click to write Choice 1"},"2":{"Display":"Click to write Choice 2"},"3":{"Display":"Click to write Choice 3"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID1"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_d7qMiMtKwcN5RL8","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID10","SecondaryAttribute":"In the example above, you should focus only on whether the final word library is a natural interp...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">In the example above, you should focus only on whether the final word <strong>library<\/strong> is a natural interpretation of the picture. <\/span><\/span>\n<ul>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">You should not judge whether the picture proves that the person is a &quot;she&quot;,&nbsp;or whether she &quot;needed&quot; to do something. <\/span><\/span><\/li>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Treat the rest of the sentence as given;&nbsp;judge only whether the sentence ending fits the situation shown.<\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<br \/>\n<span style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">When you are ready, click <strong>next<\/strong> to begin the experiment.<\/span><\/span>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q10","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"In the example above, you should focus only on whether the final word library is a natural interp...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID10"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_d7qMiMtKwcN5RL8","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID2","SecondaryAttribute":"Click to write the question text","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Click to write the question text","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q2","QuestionType":"TE","Selector":"ML","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Click to write the question text","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"SearchSource":{"AllowFreeResponse":"false"},"QuestionID":"QID2"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_d7qMiMtKwcN5RL8","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID3","SecondaryAttribute":"Click to write the question text","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Click to write the question text","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q3","QuestionType":"TE","Selector":"ML","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Click to write the question text","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"SearchSource":{"AllowFreeResponse":"false"},"QuestionID":"QID3"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_d7qMiMtKwcN5RL8","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID4","SecondaryAttribute":"Click to write the question text","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Click to write the question text","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q4","QuestionType":"Meta","Selector":"Browser","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Click to write the question text","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Browser","TextEntry":1},"2":{"Display":"Version","TextEntry":1},"3":{"Display":"Operating System","TextEntry":1},"4":{"Display":"Screen Resolution","TextEntry":1},"5":{"Display":"Flash Version","TextEntry":1},"6":{"Display":"Java Support","TextEntry":1},"7":{"Display":"User Agent","TextEntry":1}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID4"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_d7qMiMtKwcN5RL8","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID5","SecondaryAttribute":"Picture-Sentence Compatibility Ratings Thank you for taking part in this study! In this experimen...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<h1><span style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:19px;\"><strong>Picture-Sentence Compatibility Ratings <\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/h1>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Thank you for taking part in this study!<br>\n<br>\nIn this experiment, you will view a series of pictures paired with sentences. Your task is to judge <strong>how well the final word of each sentence fits the situation shown in the picture. <\/strong><br>\n<br>\nThe survey contains 80 picture-sentence pairs and should take approximately 10-15 minutes to complete.<br>\n<br>\nThere are no right or wrong answers. We are interested in your own judgments. Please answer each question based on your first impression, and avoid spending too much time on any one item.<br>\n<br>\nClick&nbsp;<strong>next<\/strong> to see detailed instructions.<\/span><\/span><\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q5","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Picture-Sentence Compatibility Ratings Thank you for taking part in this study! In this experimen...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":9,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID5"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_d7qMiMtKwcN5RL8","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID6","SecondaryAttribute":"Instructions For each question, you will see: one picture one sentence ending in a critical final...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<h1><span style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:19px;\">Instructions<\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/h1>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">For each question, you will see: <\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">one picture <\/span><\/span><\/li>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">one sentence ending in a critical final word<\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<span style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Y<\/span><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">our task is to judge <strong>how compatible the sentence's final word is with the situation shown in the picture<\/strong>.<br>\n<br>\nWhen making your judgment: <\/span><\/span>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>Focus on the final word of the sentence. <\/strong>Treat the rest of the sentence as given. <\/span><\/span><\/li>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">The picture does <strong>not<\/strong> need to prove that the sentence ending is the only possible interpretation. Simply, decide whether the final word is a <strong>natural and reasonable<\/strong> interpretation of the picture. <\/span><\/span><\/li>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Please rely on your immediate, common-sense impression rather than overthinking each item. <\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<span style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Use the following rating scale:<\/span><\/span>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>Not compatible at all.&nbsp;<\/strong>The final word is clearly inconsistent with \/ unrelated to \/ contradicts the picture.<\/span><\/span><\/li>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>Low compatibility.&nbsp;<\/strong>The final word is technically plausible but would not be commonly associated with the picture \/ it would be unusual or difficult to reconcile this sentence with the picture.<\/span><\/span><\/li>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>Uncertain.<\/strong>&nbsp;The final word provides weak \/ ambiguous \/ mixed evidence for the picture.<\/span><\/span><\/li>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>Compatible.<\/strong>&nbsp;The final word makes the sentence a reasonable interpretation of the picture.<\/span><\/span><\/li>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>Very compatible.<\/strong>&nbsp;The final word makes the sentence very consistent with \/ a natural interpretation of the picture.<\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<span style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">The following is an example of the type of questions on this survey.&nbsp;<\/span><\/span>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q6","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Instructions For each question, you will see: one picture one sentence ending in a critical final...","ChoiceOrder":["4","5","6","7","8"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":9,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID6"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_d7qMiMtKwcN5RL8","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID7","SecondaryAttribute":"Click to write the question text","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Click to write the question text","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q7","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Click to write the question text","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID7"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_d7qMiMtKwcN5RL8","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID8","SecondaryAttribute":"Sentence She needed to put everything in the library.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;\"><img height=\"512\" src=\"https:\/\/mit.co1.qualtrics.com\/CP\/Graphic.php?IM=IM_VzafRSjErA3JC6k\" style=\"width: 512px; height: 512px;\" width=\"512\" \/><\/span><\/span>\n<p data-end=\"2335\" data-start=\"2323\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;\"><strong data-end=\"2335\" data-start=\"2323\">Sentence<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<blockquote data-end=\"2387\" data-start=\"2337\">\n<p data-end=\"2387\" data-start=\"2339\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;\">She needed to put everything in the <strong data-end=\"2386\" data-start=\"2375\">library<\/strong>.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<\/blockquote>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q8","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Sentence She needed to put everything in the library.","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>1 = Not compatible at all. <\/strong>The final word is clearly inconsistent with \/ unrelated to \/ contradicts the picture.<\/span><\/span>"},"2":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>2 = Low compatibility. <\/strong>The final word is technically plausible but would not be commonly associated with the picture \/ it would be unusual or difficult to reconcile this sentence with the picture.<\/span><\/span>"},"3":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>3 = Uncertain. <\/strong>The final word provides weak \/ ambiguous \/ mixed evidence for the picture.<\/span><\/span>"},"4":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>4 = Compatible. <\/strong>The final word makes the sentence a reasonable interpretation of the picture.<\/span><\/span>"},"5":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;\"><strong>5 = Very compatible. <\/strong>The final word makes the sentence very consistent with \/ a natural interpretation of the picture.<\/span><\/span>"}},"ChoiceOrder":[1,2,3,4,5],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":6,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID8"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_d7qMiMtKwcN5RL8","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID9","SecondaryAttribute":"Click to write the question text","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Click to write the question text","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q9","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Click to write the question text","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Click to write Choice 1"},"2":{"Display":"Click to write Choice 2"},"3":{"Display":"Click to write Choice 3"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID9"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_d7qMiMtKwcN5RL8","Element":"STAT","PrimaryAttribute":"Survey Statistics","SecondaryAttribute":null,"TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"MobileCompatible":true,"ID":"Survey Statistics"}}]}